 Is it essential to prime the Carbon Cartridges?
 <span class="accordion-icon">+</span>
 </button>
 <div class="accordion-content">
 <p>Priming the Carbon Cartridges is the first step to ensuring your cartridges are completely free of any residuals from the manufacturing process. The residuals are completely normal and safe but can lead to cloudy water if the cartridges are not correctly primed.
We recommend priming your Carbon Cartridges for at least three minutes. If not primed sufficiently, the first four rounds of filtered water may have cloudy white particles that can be safely discarded.
NB: The recommended number of priming rounds depends on the type of cart you have. For full priming instructions, <a href="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0735/1821/9557/files/Phoenix_Gravity___Carbon_Filter.pdf">click here.</a></p>
