Phoenix Gravity Carbon filters are made from pure coconut shells, which are a sustainable and a renewable resource. The carbon in the filters are activated, which means that it has a high surface area and is very porous. This allows them to trap a wide range of contaminants, including chlorine, heavy metals, and other impurities. Phoenix Gravity Carbon cartridges are designed to provide clean, odorless water with a great taste. They do not release any harmful chemicals or by-products into the water, and they are super effective at removing chlorine and other volatile organic compounds A pair of carbon cartridges can filter up to 20,000 liters of water by providing safe and healthy drinking water.
</p>
