		<div class="accordion-item">
 <button class="accordion-header" onclick="toggleAccordion(this)">
 Do Phoenix Gravity Filters lower the TDS?
 <span class="accordion-icon">+</span>
 </button>
 <div class="accordion-content">
 <p>
			TDS stands for Total Dissolved Solids and is measured in parts per million (ppm) or parts per billion (ppb). It’s a measure of the water’s organic and inorganic content including minerals. Natural water will have a TDS reading from minerals picked up from the rocks and ground it flows through. It’s generally accepted that 300 ppm is a good mineral content. We purposely do not bring our TDS to zero, because we’re all about preserving the minerals your body needs.
		</p>
 </div>
 </div>
		
		<div class="accordion-item">
